# The same cube with three materials, each used twice and NOT contiguously.
# This is the case that forces the decision: six runs in file order for three materials, so either the
# reader reorders triangles to make three geometries, or the builder emits six geometries for three
# materials and pays for the extra ones.

v 0 0 0
v 1 0 0
v 1 1 0
v 0 1 0
v 0 0 1
v 1 0 1
v 1 1 1
v 0 1 1

usemtl red
f 5 6 7 8
usemtl green
f 1 4 3 2
usemtl blue
f 2 3 7 6
usemtl red
f 1 5 8 4
usemtl green
f 4 8 7 3
usemtl blue
f 1 2 6 5
